{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Overview]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A 2D action RPG about a quirky and fragile gamer named Slime's quest to become a pro gamer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To become the winner of the have-nots, strengthen your character at the shop and incorporate the abilities of defeated enemies as you climb the professional stage!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Features]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- An ability copy system that gradually expands your strategy</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 360-degree wall and ceiling cling action</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- A charge jump function that requires foresight</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Stage Details (Volume)]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is comprised of stages similar to ranked matches in e-sports titles: Bronze, Silver, Gold, Platinum, Diamond, Master, and Pro.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition, each of the Bronze through Diamond stages has four stages: I, II, III, and IV.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Conquer all 22 stages (7 bosses) to become a true pro gamer!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4044210?t=1759678291","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4044210?t=1759678291","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044210/99f0ef64a5f8ee0ce2373c9ed8eb54449d89ff11/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759678291","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044210/99f0ef64a5f8ee0ce2373c9ed8eb54449d89ff11/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759678291","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Overview]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A 2D action RPG about a quirky and fragile gamer named Slime's quest to become a pro gamer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" 